window.products.push({"id":1187038,"name":"Wireless Earbuds, Bluetooth 5.1 Earphones for Sports, with Wireless Charging Case and Earhooks Over Ear Waterproof Earphones with Mic for Sports Runni","category":"electronics","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VAFSwPX+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Amazing stereo sound quality:Adopting the high quality Bluetooth 5.1 chip, these wireless headphones for running ensure more stable connection, no long worry about the problem of disconnection after the phone is put into the pocket.In addition, Sports bluetooth headphones charging case with led Display shows remaining power in percentage. The 500mAh charging case provides 6 wireless charging for the earphones. Bluetooth 5.1 and Hi-Fi Stereo Sound Quality: bluetooth headset bring you for a better music experience. Bluetooth 5.1 version features fast and stable signal transmission, clear sound quality without skips and distortion and low power consumption. At the same time, TWS Stereo Headphones provides Hi-fi sound quality, the sound of immersive music scene surround sound, let us feel more realistic music! Ergonomic Comfort Sports Design: The true wireless earbuds included soft ears hooks are specially designed.The unique secure-fit ear hooks are customizable with multiple ear tips options to ensure the earbuds won't fall out during workouts without wire hung around neck. Perfect for running, hiking, yoga, exercises, gym, fitness, traveling and etc. Comes in 2 sizes of silicone ear buds for perfect fit and sound effect. One Step Auto Pairing: Pick up the Obbug sports earbuds from charging case, they will power on and pair with each other automatically. Then active your phone's bluetooth to search “BE1030” to connect. After the first successful connection, the sports earbuds will automatically connect to the last paired device when reboot. Even do strenuous exercise, the earbuds will not fall off.Wireless bluetooth IPX7 waterproof design to prevent daily splashes sweat and rain. Touch Control and Widely Compatible: Either earbud can be the master and touch control,while sports,driving or crossing the street,control your music, calls and voice assistant simply through intuitive touchpad technology built into both earbuds.The Wireless headphones compatible for iPhone Xs Max/XR/Xs/X/8 Plus/8/7 Plus/7, Samsung, LG, Sony,Iphone,IOS smartphone,PC Android cell Phones and other Bluetooth-enabled device.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VAFSwPX+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Obbug","source_asin":"B0BF45JLWL","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1187038","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BF45JLWL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BF45JLWL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
