window.products.push({"id":1187091,"name":"SteelSeries Scope Pro Gaming Glasses (71002)","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bb6UlrcqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description SteelSeries Scope Pro Gaming Glasses, powered by GUNNAR i-AMP lens technology, are designed to improve agamer's visual efficiency, endurance and recovery. SteelSeries' unique lens design provides superior peripheral vision with less frame obstruction. Custom Socket Sets fused with and exclusive frame fabrication offer gamers a distinct style and fit for greater comfort and clarity. From the Manufacturer SteelSeries Scope, powered by GUNNAR i-AMP lens technology, are designed to improve a gamer's visual efficiency, endurance, and recovery. SteelSeries' unique lens design provides superior peripheral vision with less frame obstruction. Custom Socket Sets fused with an exclusive frame fabrication offer gamers a distinct style and fit for greater comfort and clarity. GUNNAR eyewear is designed to minimize eye strain and visual stress, while improving contrast, comfort, and focus. Designed to improve a gamer's visual efficiency, endurance, and recovery. View larger Improves Visual Efficiency GUNNAR's lens tint, coating, focusing power, and curvature create an environment for sharper, clearer vision to help your eyes work more efficiently, protect against fatigue and enhance overall contrast, focus and detail. Minimizes Eye Strain Eyestrain, visual stress, and dry eyes can be caused by extended periods of near to intermediate distance computer viewing. The SteelSeries Scope helps relax the ocular muscles so you can spend more time gaming without getting eye fatigue and even headaches. If your eyes feel more relaxed, you can stay focused, play longer, and maybe even nab some extra frags. The SteelSeries Scope protects against environmental barriers that can cause vision problems when viewing digital screens. The lens tint, coatings, and curvature combat issues like harsh fluorescent light, blue light, glare, and ambient air currents that can cause your eyes to dry out and strain. Improves Visual Recovery The Scope helps keep your eyes fresh and relaxed. The lens tint, coatings, and curvature help reduce issues like eye strain, dry eyes, and visual stress which can help visual recovery after marathon gaming sessions. The Fit Ergonomically designed, the lens and frame solution are constructed with the most advanced lightweight, yet durable materials available. Scope also features headset-compatible temples for enhanced comfort with headsets. They work great with SteelSeries gaming headsets: all SteelSeries headsets provide enough cushion in the earcups so that Scope glasses won't dig into your temples. What Critics Are Saying About SteelSeries Scope \"The warmth of the lens on the Scope glasses helps to prevent this drying out thanks to their shape, design and colour-swatch. Not only is the onscreen action warmer but it is magnified also. Action is sharp and the eyes are no longer straining or drying out.\" --Vortez \"If you are serious at all about your gaming, you NEED to buy the SteelSeries Scope pro gaming glasses. They will give you an advantage and help you reach that next level. Plus they are absolutely comfortable to wear and are thing and lightweight, making them ideal travel companions.\" --Gamingallthetime.com \"The SteelSeries scope combines style, comfort, protection, and enhancement. Everything you would expect from a high quality gaming product. I highly recommend these to anybody suffering from ocular exhaustion either at work or at home.\" --Nerd Reactor","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bb6UlrcqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SteelSeries","source_asin":"B005INAIQ0","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1187091","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005INAIQ0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B005INAIQ0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
