window.products.push({"id":1187132,"name":"SoundPEATS Wireless Earbuds Air3 Deluxe HS with Hi-Res Audio Certification and LDAC Codec, Bluetooth 5.2 Earphones with 4 Mics and ENC for Calls, 14.2","category":"electronics","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51IsLM4QuhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Hi-Res Audio Certification] - 🎙 CNET Best Earbuds of 2022 🎙. World’s first certificated Hi-Res Audio semi-in-ear wireless earbuds authorized by the Japan Audio Society. It creates a revolutionary breakthrough and brings ultimate music enjoyment and extreme comfort. The frequency response up to 20Hz-40KHz (usually 20Hz-20KHz for other fellows) reproduces the delicate and fresh original sound and restores the beauty of vocals and musical instruments. [Leading Audio Codec LDAC] - The LDAC codec adopts a hybrid encoding scheme to provide more efficient data compression. It ensures a maximum transfer rate of 990kbps and achieves sound quality transmission up to 24bit/96KHz. Compared with SBC, the LDAC can transfer information content up to three times. It reduces sound distortion and achieves a significant improvement in sound quality. (🍀 Note: Not active noise cancelling earbuds) [14.2mm Driver & Four Microphones] - Built-in 14.2mm big dynamic driver with open sound field delicately restores heavy low frequencies, clear and high-resolution mids and highs to present powerful and naturally tuned sound. The dual mic design and advanced ENC (Environmental Noise Cancellation) technology precisely pick up the human voice in calls and effectively reduce the ambient noise interference, so your voice call can be as clear and smooth as a face-to-face chat, even in a noisy environment. [In-Ear Detection & 20 Hours of Playtime] - Insert the earbuds to play instantly and automatically pause when taking them off. The responsive in-ear detection sensor and intuitive touch control make the Air3 Deluxe HS earbuds easy to operate and exclude all discomfort. The earbuds last up to 5 hours of listening time (varies by volume and audio files) from a single charge and get three recharges by the charging case. So you can enjoy a stress-free listening experience up to 20 hours in total. [Low Latency Game Mode & App Control] - Triple tap on the left earbud to enter the 60ms low-latency game mode. Synchronized image and sound let you precisely catch the position and preemptively seize the winning opportunity, which is perfect for mobile games. You can download and register the SOUNDPEATS App for customizable manipulation. (📱: The App supports upgrading the firmware. 🎯 Note: Please rest assured, the earbuds work very well if you don't want to download and register the App.)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51IsLM4QuhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SoundPEATS","source_asin":"B0BQTKVGS8","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1187132","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQTKVGS8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQTKVGS8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
