window.products.push({"id":1187134,"name":"GIWOX 3D Hologram Fan, Large Holographic Fan Display w/928 Pcs Beads, 1280P High Brightness Hologram Fan Projector for Trade Show Exhibition 31.5''","category":"electronics","retail price":539.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51T+2RLKowL._AC_SL1345_.jpg","description":"➤[Top-notch 3D Effect]: The image of 3D Hologram LED Fan has no borders and background, which makes you feel it completely appears in the air and creates best attraction for your products or events. Hologram Fan with high brightness makes the effect much clearer and brighter, great for outside (need waterproof case in rainy day.) Widely used in exhibition, department store, cultural tourism, Christmas Halloween decorations, garden, families, wedding, etc. ➤[Multiple Holographic Fans Synchronization]: Multiple GIWOX 3D holographic display fans can be joined together to form huge holographic video wall, no sync cable required, much easier to assemble the video wall and update content, almost any size you need can be achieved, impressive 3D visuals will do wonders for your booth at trade shows. We can make wall stand, floor stand, and various shapes and materials case cover for Hologram fan wall to keep the fans safe and waterproof. ➤ [Rich Content]: Holographic fan projection can display high-definition images and colors of highly restored images and videos, and it has a strong 3D sense. The display content can be customized and freely changed, and the operation is flexible. Note: The videos need to be produced by 3D software in order to appear 3D in the holographic fan, and the background of the videos needs to be black. ➤ [3D Hologram Fan Parameter]: Four-axis design + 31.5'' Large Size + 1280P High Resolution + 928pcs LED Beads + 2400cd/㎡ Brightness, 50% brighter than old version + Support Bluetooth Speaker to play sounds + Phone APP (Android and IOS) & PC Software (Win7/8/10) + High transfer speed (2MB/1s) + APP with built in 3D videos and 3D text creation function + Free 3D Video Library up to 800pcs. ➤ [Easy Installation]: Install without screws. 1. The side with LED lights is facing up, the other side with circuits and chips is facing down. 2. Insert A strap into A slot, B strap into B slot. 3. Safety buckle is completely locked. Safety tip: Remember to check that the safety buckle is fully spring locked. If the safety buckle is not locked, the light strip will be thrown out.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51T+2RLKowL._AC_SL1345_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GIWOX","source_asin":"B0B7J17NTX","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1187134","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7J17NTX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7J17NTX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
