window.products.push({"id":1187308,"name":"AAXA KP500-01 P4 Pico Projector, 80 Lumens, Pocket Size, Li-Ion Battery, 15000 Hour LED Projector, WindowsCE, Media Player, Black","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41vLJNxwivL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description AAXA Technologies is excited to announce the P4 Pico Projector - The world's brightest battery-powered projector. The AAXA P4 Picro Projector features a dazzling 80 lumens high-contrast optical engine powered by Texas Instrument's DLP. Combined with AAXA's Vibrant-Color technology the P4 features long-life 15,000 hour LEDs. The P4 was designed for today's on-the-go executive and features a powerful Windows CE ARM processor with 2GB of onboard memory with optional keyboard and mouse the P4 can run multiple applications including Microsoft Office Mobile, Adobe, mobile games and a variety of other Windows CE applications. From the Manufacturer With the optional keyboard, run multiple applications The P4 Pico projector from AAXA Technologies is the world's brightest battery-powered projector. The AAXA P4 pico projector features a dazzling 80-lumen, high-contrast optical engine powered by Texas Instruments' DLP. Combined with AAXA's Vibrant-Color technology, the P4 features long-life 15,000-hour LEDs and can deliver a brilliant colorful image of up to 80\". Designed for today's on-the-go executive Great for On-the-Go The P4 was designed for today's on-the-go executive and features a powerful Windows CE ARM processor with 2GB of onboard memory. With an optional keyboard and mouse the P4 can run multiple applications including Microsoft Office mobile, Adobe, mobile games, and a variety of other Windows CE applications. Truly Mobile At less than 5.6\" long, 2.7\" wide, and 1.2\" tall the P4 is both a true pocket projector and a powerful mobile computing platform. The P4 features a built-in lithium-ion battery capable of powering the projector over 75 minutes on a single charge. Additional features include Micro SD Card slot, USB on-the-go, composite video input, VGA input, and a 1-watt onboard speaker. Windows CE Operating System The Windows CE Operating system allows the use of Microsoft Office, Adobe and 3rd party applications. The AAXA P4 produces a vivid display with amazing color saturation due to Vibrant Color Technology, DLP, and the triple LED light source. View larger The P4's onboard media player supports popular file formats, allowing you to share movies, videos, and photos with friends and family. Super Color and Image Quality The Vibrant Color Technology and triple LED light source in the P4 produces a vivid display with amazing color saturation. Long LED Life Conventional lamp-based projectors require frequent bulb changes with very expensive bulbs that cost hundreds of dollars. The P4's LED light source lasts 10 times longer than conventional lamps so bulb changes are a thing of the past. Brightest in Class The AAXA P4 produces the brightest image of it's class in DC and battery powered modes. The AAXA P4 runs at 80 lumens which outclasses the competition in the pico projector market. The P4 is almost twice as bright as its other competitors even on battery power. Quick ON and OFF Long warm-up and cool down times, sometimes for several minutes, are required for projectors using traditional lamps. The LED light source enables the P4 to achieve full brightness within seconds. Of course, it turns off instantly as well. Versatile Multimedia Support The P4 has many ways to connect to your favorite multimedia devices. Simply insert a Micro SD Card, USB Flash drive to view your video, picture, music, and text files. You can also use the composite video input, VGA input to connect to external devices such as iPod, iPad, iPhone, mobile phones, notebook/PC, game console or more The P4's onboard media player supports popular file formats, allowing you to share movies, videos, and photos with friends and family. Bring presentations anywhere and everywhere. Enjoy gaming and entertainment without needing a large TV. The P4's LED light source consumes less power. The LED is also 100% free of mercury and, as the bulb never needs to be replaced, there are no discarded bulbs. Which AAXA Projector is Right for You?","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41vLJNxwivL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AAXA Technologies","source_asin":"B0087WKR10","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1187308","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0087WKR10","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0087WKR10","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
