window.products.push({"id":1187381,"name":"The Crasher by JLab Loud Portable Bluetooth Stereo Speaker with 18 Hour Battery - Miami Purple / Mint","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+373qK9NL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Crashing the party with style, The Crasher Portable Bluetooth Speaker dominates the competition in every way: Bluetooth: Free your music from cumbersome wires with the magic of Bluetooth. Stream your music from up to 30-Feet away or plug in with the included aux flat cable. The Crasher is ready to party with your favorite portable devices, anytime, anywhere. Sound: The Crasher's hi-fi digital amp powers two JLab engineered full-range drivers for ‘so fresh and so clean,’ mids and highs for warm, rich room filling sound while the rear passive subwoofer pumps enough bass to wake the neighbors. Playtime: Outlasting its wet blanket competitors, The Crasher boasts 2x the rechargeable Li-Ion battery size to keep the party going for up to 18 hours. In the words of Abe Lincoln, Don't stop the party! Phone Calls: A built-in mic and speaker phone makes taking calls easier than ever, creating the perfect portable conference experience of your white-collar dreams! Charging: Need juice? No problem. The Crasher is one of the only Bluetooth speakers on the market that can fully charge your smartphone or tablet while it continues to blast your favorite jock jams! Plug into the Crasher’s full size USB port and juice up. ABC - Always Be Charging! Good looks: The Crasher's sleek yet rugged anodized aluminum housing boasts electric color schemes to complement the perfect sound crushing acoustics. Accessories: The Crasher comes standard with USB AC Power Adapter, AUX Cable, USB Cable, and matching microfiber carrying pouch. Plays well with iPod, iPad, iPad Mini, iPhone, Android, Windows Phones, Blackberry, Kindle, Kindle Fire, and all other devices with Bluetooth or a 3.5mm jack. *tested at medium volume","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+373qK9NL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JLab","source_asin":"B00A44RLWC","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1187381","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00A44RLWC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B00A44RLWC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
