window.products.push({"id":1187606,"name":"BAMST, WiFi Extender, WiFi Booster 1200Mbps, WiFi Extenders Signal Booster for Home, 2.4G & 5G WiFi Signal Booster 360degree Full Coverage WiFi Repeat","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61O1CiVJihL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Brand Mmuse. Are you tired of the slow and spotty internet connection Choose our WiFi extender, just plug it into an outlet, and your problem is solved!Q1: How to connect the WiFi signal booster to my routerMethod One :Step 1: Plug in the WiFi extenders signal booster for home and wait for about 60s, you can see that the 2.4G/5G/Power lights turn to green.Step 2 : Press the wps button on your router and WiFi signal booster for 2s.Step 3 : Wait for 60-90s, device gets linked to the WiFi network without making you type in a username and password.Method Two :Step 1: Plug in the WiFi repeater and wait for about 30s, you can see that the 2.4G/5G/Power lights turn to green.Step 2 : Open your browser and search 192.168.188.1Step 3 : Input the password admin to login in and then choose your router.Step 4 : Enter your router password, and click next to set your SSID password.Step 5: Wait for 60s, the two devices will be connectec and the extender light turn to green.Step 6: Select and connect to the new WiFi booster network( -pro-2.4g/-pro-5g).Q2. How to confirm that the WiFi Booster and Signal Amplifier is connected successfullyPlease observe the light on the extender: if all four signal lights are on green, then the setup was successful.Q3. Why I can not input the passwordPlease notice that when you input your router password, the special characters like ~ and blank can not allowed.Q4. How to reset the WiFi extenderPlease press the WPS button on the dual band WiFi Extender for 15s. Or press the reset hole for 2s.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61O1CiVJihL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BAMST","source_asin":"B08YDGPBCV","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1187606","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YDGPBCV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YDGPBCV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
