window.products.push({"id":1187655,"name":"Fotodiox DLX Stretch Lens Mount Adapter - Canon EOS (EF/EF-S) D/SLR Lens to Micro Four Thirds (MFT, M4/3) Mount Mirrorless Camera Body with Macro Focu","category":"electronics","retail price":98.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AAZYw8rQL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The Fotodiox DLX Stretch Adapter allows you to extend the lens from the camera body giving the ability to focus closer than normal as well as correct for any possible back focus the lens may have, in effect this adapter acts like a small built-in bellows. Lens Compatibility Note: Normal Canon lenses have many electronic features that are disabled when using a mechanical adapter such as this one. This adapter is best used with manual focus lenses designed for the Canon EF mount or lenses that have been converted with a Canon EF bayonet that offer aperture control from the lens. Compatible Micro Four Thirds mount Cameras (including but not limited to): • Various Micro Four Thirds mount cameras • NOT Compatible with Olympus OM-D cameras Please Note: • 'Focus-By-Wire' lenses (such as Canon's STM or Nikons AF-P) requires power to engage the manual focus rings on the lens, since manual lens mount adapters do not power the lens, those lenses will not be able to focus. • This is a manual adapter, so lens functions that rely on electronic communication with the camera body (autofocus, AE metering, image stabilization, etc.) will be disrupted. • We state “infinity focus allowed” because our adapters are designed to be universal which can prevent some lenses from focusing to infinity at the infinity mark. • Set your camera to “Manual’ or ‘Aperture Priority’ for metering. If camera does not release be sure to enable ‘shoot without lens’ in camera settings. • All pictures are for illustration purposes only. Actual product may vary slightly due to ongoing improvements in design.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AAZYw8rQL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fotodiox","source_asin":"B06Y2H8B2P","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1187655","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06Y2H8B2P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B06Y2H8B2P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
