window.products.push({"id":1187696,"name":"REX-BLU Boombotix REX 1.0 2013 (Electric Blue)","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91SlfjptFZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Boombotix Boombot REX Wireless Bluetooth Speaker The Boombot REX is the next evolution of smart wireless speakers in the ultraportable Boombot collection. With revolutionary acoustic and industrial design, a noise-canceling microphone, Siri/voice-control integration and a built-in clip, the Boombot REX allows you to stay connected to your friends and your music while keeping your phone safely in your pocket. The Boombot REX connects to iPods, smartphones, tablets, and laptops using wireless Bluetooth technology. You can stream music, change tracks, and answer, end or deny phone calls on the fly. The Boombot REX is built to withstand the demands of an active lifestyle so you can bring music to where you enjoy it most. The Boombot REX compresses dual drivers and a bass woofer to give you the sound of a dock at a fraction of the size. The clip-on design of Boombot REX allows you to experience hands free versatility in a variety of conditions. Nano Acoustics Deliver Huge Sound in a Small Package Featuring two custom tuned 36mm drivers and a passive bass woofer, the Boombot REX can crank up to 99+ decibels in Bluetooth mode. A built-in equalizer monitors the frequencies being played to significantly reduce distortion and create a clear, full range sound. You can fill up a room with music or entertain your friends at the park. The palm-sized form factor of the Boombot REX makes this wireless Bluetooth speaker ideal for your next adventure.  The Boombot REX's water-resistant construction lets you have high-fidelity sound even in rain or snow. Give Yourself Wireless Freedom with Voice Control The Boombot REX pairs with any Bluetooth compatible device including smartphones, MP3 players, tablets and computers. With a 33-foot range you can move around freely with your music. Press the center button for two seconds and ping Siri or voice-control to change music, ask for directions and much more. Take Your Audio Anywhere, Anytime Boombots are the original ultraportable speaker; their industrial design is built for life in motion. With a built-on clip, Boombots can easily strap onto your backpack, pocket or jacket. Whether you're biking to work, walking your dog or hanging out at the beach, you'll be able to effortlessly take your music with you. Designed for Your Adventure Most aplus go into hibernation as soon as there is some precipitation in the air. The Boombot REX, however, features a water-resistant construction. When the rain (or snow) clouds open up for business, you can still enjoy high fidelity sound. Boombot REXs were also designed with a drop-tested, ruggedized ABS Shell. What does that mean? The Boombot REX can take a beating. In the event that you somehow manage to break your Boombot, don't fret — all of our Boombots come with a one-year \"No Matter What\" warranty. Make Your Home Devices Wireless Say you have a nice speaker setup at home, but it's not Bluetooth compatible. With your Boombot REX paired to your audio device, you can plug your Boombot REX into that speaker system using an auxiliary cord. In addition to being a speaker, the Boombot REX now doubles as a Bluetooth receiver and channels your audio signal into your speaker system. Revive any antiquated system with wireless audio technology. Connect an infinite amount of Boombot REX speakers in-line using the included auxiliary cable. Build Your System with Infinite Daisy-Chain Capability One is cool, two is better, and three is a party. The Boombot REX has an audio-input and output jack that allows you to daisy-chain (connect multiple speakers) as long as you'd like. Each unit includes an audio cable. What's in the Box One male-to-male 1/8\" audio cable, micro USB charging cable (2-foot), Boombotix sticker, International user manual. Specifications Audio: Proprietary 36mm acoustic drivers (stereo pair) and passive bass woofer mastered with dynamic DSP tuning Audio: Proprietary 36mm acoustic drivers (stereo pair) and passive bass woofer mastered with dynamic DSP tuning USB: microUSB (charging only) USB: microUSB (charging only) Stereo input: 3.5mm jack Stereo input: 3.5mm jack Stereo output: 3.5mm jack for unlimited daisy-chain capability Stereo output: 3.5mm jack for unlimited daisy-chain capability PC compatibility: Windows 7, Vista, XP; Mac OS X 10.5 and higher PC compatibility: Windows 7, Vista, XP; Mac OS X 10.5 and higher Bluetooth: Version 2.1+EDR Bluetooth: Version 2.1+EDR Bluetooth profiles: Advanced Audio Distribution Profile (A2DP) 1.2, Hands-Free Profile (HFP) 1.5, Headset Profile (HSP) 1.1 Bluetooth profiles: Advanced Audio Distribution Profile (A2DP) 1.2, Hands-Free Profile (HFP) 1.5, Headset Profile (HSP) 1.1 Battery life: Up to 6 hours of continuous play (varies by volume level and audio content) Battery life: Up to 6 hours of continuous play (varies by volume level and audio content) Battery status: Displayed on iPhone Battery status: Displayed on iPhone Compare the Boombotix Speakers Model Boombot Rex Boombot 2 Stereo Full Range 50M","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91SlfjptFZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Boombotix","source_asin":"B00BM3N1CI","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1187696","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BM3N1CI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BM3N1CI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
