window.products.push({"id":1187829,"name":"BEYONDTECH LC to LC Fiber Patch Cable Multimode Duplex - 1m (3.28ft) - 50/125um OM3 10G LSZH (2 Pack) PureOptics Cable Series","category":"electronics","retail price":16.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816pO1gXoML._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Easy installation Beyondtech OM3 50/125 LC to LC Fiber Patch cable simplify the installation process and reduce the total cost of ownership of your project, due to pre-terminated fiber intrinsic plug-and-play characteristic. 10 Gigabit Performance OM3 laser optimized fiber patch cords are designed to be used in LAN, WAN and SAN 10GB networks and is able of handling the most challenging telecommunications data transmission requests. Fully compatible with VCESL laser light sources and existing 50/125 equipment. Properly tested Each patch cord is individually and rigorously tested and certified to be within accurate optical insertion loss. Cable Specifications: Wavelengths: 850 and 1300 Aqua Jacket Bend Radius: Minimum / 5cm Cable Jacket: 3.0mm LSZH Operating Temperature: -4° to 158° F (-20° to +70° C) Core:OM3 50/125 Standard Zip Cord OM3 50/125 fiber conforms to ITU-T G.651.1, TIA/EIA 492AAAC and IEC60793-2-10 A1a.2a standards Multiple Sizes Available LC/LC connector (Fiber Patch Cable) Beyondtech LC LC Patch Cord feature precision hold, plastic ferrule. They comply with all RoHS environmental specifications. LC to LC Multimode Duplex are designed for LC / LC fast Ethernet, Fiber Channel, Gigabit Ethernet Speeds, data center, premises, educational, LAN, SAN, commercial and Asynchronous Transfer Mode (ATM) applications. It supports video, data and voice services.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816pO1gXoML._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BEYONDTECH","source_asin":"B07GVQMRF6","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1187829","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GVQMRF6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GVQMRF6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1187830,"name":"Bowens BW-4805USDAP Gemini 500R/500R Ump/Ump Kit (Black)","category":"electronics","retail price":1304.04,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MK6T4zNUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The best-selling Gemini 500R professional flash lighting kit contains everything you need to start shooting portraiture in the studio and, with the addition of an optional Travelpak battery, Bowens studio quality lighting can go anywhere. Of course like all Bowens kits, the Gemini 500R/500R Kit is an exceptional value for the money. Bowens standard features such as fast recycling (1.3 sec) and short flash durations (1/900s) are all here as well as a full 5 stop flash power range (500Ws-15Ws) digitally controlled by twin dials, one for stops and the other for 1/10th stop precision control. A switch controls the bright 250W modeling lamp which can be set to Full (100%), Proportional with the flash power, User defined or Off when required. Each Gemini 500R flash head features a slot to plug in a Pulsar or PocketWizard Radio Receiver Module (optional, sold separately). Using PocketWizard Receiver Modules enables compatibility with all PocketWizard radio triggers and Sekonic radio-enabled light meters, making triggering and exposure measurement simple and easy. The ability for radio triggering coupled with the versatility of being mains (AC) or optional Travelpak Battery (DC) powered means that the Gemini 500R kit is one of the most popular professional flash kits available today.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MK6T4zNUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bowens","source_asin":"B00KADG6M8","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1187830","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KADG6M8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KADG6M8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
