window.products.push({"id":1187915,"name":"Throttle Quadrant Software Bundle with Around The World in 80 Flights and Wellington","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91HJaUB6OXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Give the gift of Flight this holiday season, with the new Throttle Quadrant Software Bundle, by CH Products! The Throttle Quadrant takes you from the computer to the cockpit, with its driverless USB installation and can be configured to resemble the throttle control of twin engine and multi-engine aircrafts, with the removable 4 black, 2 blue and 2 red knobs included. Completely user customizable with the Control Manager programming software, offering a total of 350 button positions if so configured, the system is ideal for precise control of multiple engines, flaps, fuel mixture, lights, and much, much more. Discover the world around you with Around the World in 80 Flights, a stunning recreation of the 1937 Lockheed Electra 10E. Experience this 80-leg journey around the world, covering nearly 35,000 miles, over 400 hours of flying time and more than 112 countries. Each of the detailed legs of the journey can be flow as individual or consecutive missions with a flight plan, pilots notes, full briefing and a guide to many of the great wonders of the world that pass beneath your wings. The entire route has been carefully chosen to showcase the breathtaking beauty of the planet. From the first RAF bombing raid of WW2, to hunting submarines over treacherous waters, the Wellington became one of the great success stories of Anglo-Allied operations. Featuring the 4 most popular variants of the Vickers Wellington, with their authentic cockpit layouts and precision handling, aviation history bursts into dramatic life. Lavishly detailed aircraft, period scenery and challenging FSX missions come together to relive the unforgettable experience of the glory days of the Wellington.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91HJaUB6OXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CH Products","source_asin":"B00405SM5Q","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1187915","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00405SM5Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B00405SM5Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
