window.products.push({"id":1187919,"name":"KINGJOY Video Camera Tripod Professional Fluid Head Tripod 61\" for Canon Nikon DSLR with 1/4\" Quick Release Plate Zipper Bag Max Load 22 Lbs for Vlog ","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61I6K-FsFHS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【EASY TO USE & WIDE COMPATIBILITY】KINGJOY professional tripod with 1/4\" quick release plate have dual insurance locking design, it's very easy to used, effectively prevent the devices from dropping, compatible with most high-end and heavy devices: Canon, Nikon, SONY etc, also include in video camera, binoculars, laser level and most devices with 1/4\" screw, perfect for photographers, videographers, traveler etc. 【FLUID HEAD & MULTI-ANGLE PHOTOGRAPHY】Fluid head features dynamic balancing system, built-in smooth fluid damping regulation design, fixed fluid drags in both the pan and tilt axes, make fluid head operate smooth, it can horizontally rotate 360° and vertical tilt -70°~ + 90°. Camera tripod has bubble level and accurate scales, help you find accurate angles, it can quickly achieve panorama shooting, macro shooting or low angle shooting, so you get perfect videos and stunning panoramas every time. 【HIGH QUALITY & ULTRA STABILITY】KINGJOY camera tripod is mainly made of aluminum magnesium alloy, it has also been processed several times with high-intensity shock absorption. Use weight hook and center column tighten knob, plus non-slip rubber feet, it can be kept stable. It max load 22 lbs, suitable for high-end and professional equipment, that can handle more weight, with strong compatibility and stability. 【PROFESSIONAL & MULTIPLEX ADJUSTMENTS】The adjustable tripod has 3 adjustments gears and 3 sections legs, it can quickly adjust the high, medium and low angle, adjust from 23\" to 61\". The fluid head tripod center column can be inverted to provide a low angle shooting and macro shooting, of course you can also taking it out for hand-held photography, it allows your camera to shooting objects more closely and enlarge its texture and quality. 【KINGJOY BRAND & 100% SATISFACTION PROMISE】We are the KINGJOY brand, we are 100% genuine guaranteed. If you are looking for a tripod with both price and performance, KINGJOY video camera tripod will be your overwhelming choice. We provide 30 days free of return, 100% satisfying and 24h customer service. Package included: 1x Fluid Head Tripod, 1x Zipper Bag, 1x Wrench Tool, 1x Product Manual.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61I6K-FsFHS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KINGJOY","source_asin":"B01NBOXM7S","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1187919","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01NBOXM7S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B01NBOXM7S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
